+# CONTRACT — Reactive Spreadsheet Engine
+
+Definition of done. Every item must pass via Vitest (`npm test`), build clean (`npm run build`), lint clean (`npm run lint`).
+
+## Cell references & coordinates
+- [ ] `A1`, `Z100`, `AA1`, `AB12` parse to correct (col,row) → unit tests on col conversion via observable behavior
+- [ ] Column letters case-insensitive (`a1` == `A1`) → set('a1',x); get('A1')===x
+- [ ] Invalid ref (`1A`, `A`, `A0`, `""`, `A1B`) throws on set/get → expect throw
+
+## Literal values
+- [ ] Number literal stored & returned as number → set('A1',42); get===42
+- [ ] String literal stored & returned as string → set('A1','hi'); get==='hi'
+- [ ] Boolean literal stored & returned as boolean → set('A1',true); get===true
+- [ ] Empty/unset cell get returns null → get('Z9')===null
+- [ ] A non-`=` string is a plain string, not coerced (`'42'` stays string) → get==='42'
+
+## Formulas — arithmetic
+- [ ] `=A1+A2` adds → 10+20=30
+- [ ] `-`, `*`, `/` work → tests each
+- [ ] Parentheses grouping `=(A1+B1)*2` → correct precedence
+- [ ] Operator precedence `=A1+A2*2` → mul before add
+- [ ] Unary minus `=-A1`, `=A1*-1` → correct
+- [ ] Reference to empty cell treated as 0 in arithmetic → `=A1+1` with A1 empty → 1
+- [ ] Division by zero → `#DIV/0!`
+- [ ] Arithmetic on non-numeric string → `#VALUE!`
+- [ ] Boolean coerces in arithmetic (true→1,false→0) → `=A1+1` A1=true → 2
+
+## Formulas — comparisons (in IF)
+- [ ] `>`,`<`,`>=`,`<=`,`=`,`<>` produce booleans → IF tests
+- [ ] Numeric comparison correct → 5>3 true
+- [ ] String equality/inequality → "a"="a" true, "a"<>"b" true
+- [ ] `=A1=B1` (leading = stripped, inner = is compare) → boolean
+
+## Built-in functions (ranges)
+- [ ] `SUM(A1:A3)` sums numeric, ignores strings/empty → correct
+- [ ] `SUM` over block range `A1:B2` → all cells
+- [ ] `SUM` over row range `A1:C1` → correct
+- [ ] `AVERAGE` mean of numeric; no numbers → `#DIV/0!`
+- [ ] `MIN`/`MAX` over numeric → correct; empty → 0
+- [ ] `COUNT` counts numeric values only → ignores strings/empty
+- [ ] Functions accept multiple/scalar args `SUM(A1,A2,5)` → correct
+- [ ] `IF(cond,t,f)` returns branch by condition → big/small example
+- [ ] `IF` with 2 args (no else) → false branch defaults to false
+- [ ] Unknown function → `#NAME?`
+- [ ] Function names case-insensitive (`sum`) → works
+
+## Ranges
+- [ ] Column range `A1:A5` expands to 5 cells
+- [ ] Row range `A1:C1` expands to 3 cells
+- [ ] Block range `A1:C3` expands to 9 cells
+- [ ] Reversed range `C3:A1` handled same as `A1:C3`
+
+## Reactive updates
+- [ ] Changing A1 updates B1=`=A1+1` automatically → 5→10 yields 6→11
+- [ ] Transitive: A1→B1→C1 chain all update → multi-hop
+- [ ] Updating a cell updates SUM that includes it → SUM recomputes
+- [ ] Changing a cell does NOT corrupt unrelated cells
+
+## Circular reference detection
+- [ ] Direct self `A1==A1` throws
+- [ ] Two-cycle A1=B1, B1=A1 throws on second set
+- [ ] Indirect cycle A1→B1→C1→A1 throws
+- [ ] Throwing leaves prior state intact (no partial mutation)
+- [ ] Error propagation: cell referencing an error cell yields the error
+
+## API surface
+- [ ] `get` returns computed value (string|number|boolean|null)
+- [ ] `getDisplay` returns string; null→"" ; numbers/bools/strings stringified
+- [ ] `getCells` returns Map of all non-empty cells → computed values
+- [ ] Reassigning a formula cell to a literal updates deps (old deps no longer trigger it)
